    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a temperature-dependent trait section for size rules. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class extends <ref refid="class_trait_temperature_section" kindref="compound">TraitTemperatureSection</ref> to provide functionality for traits where the size of an individual depends on temperature. It stores a mapping from temperature to expected dry mass and provides methods to generate individual trait sections and deserialize traits. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
